<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A4106010" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "03" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Brake Light Switch On-Vehicle Inspection
</title>
<ptxt>
Depress the brake pedal until brake light turns on and measure the brake pedal stroke to that point.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
If the pedal stroke is not as specified, remove and reinstall brake light switch.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Brake pedal stroke until brake light turns on “a”
</title>
<ptxt>
LHD: 5.4 – 13.5 mm (0.21 – 0.53 in.)
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
RHD: 6.3 – 15.9 mm (0.25 – 0.63 in.)
</ptxt>
</spec>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IAP70B410015.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "47.048mm" ver = "01" gw = "60" gh = "117"/>
</figure>
</servinfo>
</servinfotype>
</configtype>
</servcat>
</section></manual></suzuki>
